    documentation="Purpose and Description&#xD;&#xA;The Customer and Stakeholder Engagement Value Stream ensures that the statistical organization remains connected to its users, partners, and data providers.&#xD;&#xA;It translates user needs into actionable requirements, supports service delivery, and promotes transparency and collaboration. This value stream guarantees that statistical products and services remain relevant, trusted, and user-oriented, while fostering partnerships with public institutions, researchers, and the broader data ecosystem.&#xD;&#xA;"
